flowchart TB
  accTitle: 教程中的四组 Claude Code 插件与 Skills
  accDescr: Superpowers 组织设计、实现和验证流程；Code Review 与 Simplifier 用于审查和简化；Karpathy Skills 强调最小改动与明确假设；Academic Research Skills 覆盖论文规划、写作、修订和引文检查。
  subgraph workflow["Superpowers · 开发流程"]
    direction LR
    design["构思需求<br/>编写实施计划"]
    develop["先测试后实现<br/>结构化调试"]
    verify["运行验证<br/>再声明完成"]
    design --> develop --> verify
  end
  subgraph quality["Code Review & Simplifier · 代码质量"]
    direction LR
    review["审查当前 diff<br/>/code-review"]
    fix["审查并修复<br/>/code-review --fix"]
    simplify["简化重复与逻辑<br/>/simplify"]
    review --> fix --> simplify
  end
  subgraph principles["Karpathy Skills · 编码准则"]
    direction LR
    simple["避免过度工程化<br/>保持实现简单"]
    scope["限定修改范围<br/>坚持最小改动"]
    explicit["暴露假设<br/>定义可验证标准"]
    simple ~~~ scope ~~~ explicit
  end
  subgraph research["Academic Research Skills · 论文工作"]
    direction LR
    plan["规划与大纲<br/>/ars-plan · /ars-outline"]
    write["全文与摘要<br/>/ars-full · /ars-abstract"]
    revise["/ars-revision<br/>/ars-citation-check"]
    plan --> write --> revise
  end
  workflow ~~~ quality ~~~ principles ~~~ research
